# Security headers for every docs page and asset. Cloudflare applies this file to static-asset
# responses; the docs Worker is assets-only, so that is every response.
# Never add Cache-Control under /*: the @astrojs/cloudflare adapter then skips the immutable
# /_astro/* rule it prepends to this file at build time.
# HSTS starts short; raise max-age to 31536000 once HTTPS-only has run cleanly for a week.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=86400
